  "verification_hint": "After the fix the resource is declared inside the try's parentheses, the manual close() call is gone, and any nested try/catch that existed only to swallow that close()'s exception is either removed (when the enclosing catch already covers it) or preserved explicitly. javac -source 1.7 must accept the resource type, which proves it implements AutoCloseable.",
